+- list lengths: uniformly selected from 0 through 8
+- elements: a 25% mixture from the boundary grid plus +/- maximum finite;
+  otherwise uniform finite samples from [-1e6, 1e6]
+- thresholds: a 35% mixture from the threshold grid; otherwise uniform finite
+  samples from [-10, 1e6]
+
+Oracle and comparison:
+- trusted entry point: /reference/canonical.py::has_close_elements
+- generated entry point: /tmp/audit-work/reconstruction/solution.py::has_close_elements
